WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: The Masquerade (1-04)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: Carnaby Street (1983)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:41.200
[Dramatic Piano & Sweeping Analog Strings Intro]

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.000
We paint the faces, we choose the dress

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.800
To hide the pieces of the emptiness

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.800
We walk the avenue in borrowed clothes

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.800
And play the part that everybody knows

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
A gallery of ghosts inside the hall

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:08.800
We smile to prove we haven't lost it all

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.600
Welcome to the masquerade!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.500
In the fragile fortress we have made!

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.400
Spinning in the shadows, out of sight!

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:24.800
Dancing on the edges of the night!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.500
In the masquerade...

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.200
The music swelters and the voices rise

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:41.000
To drown the secrets in our weary eyes

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.800
We hold together when the curtain falls

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.800
But no one answers when the echo calls

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:54.200
A beautiful illusion we protect

00:01:54.800 --> 00:02:00.800
A grand design of cause and of effect

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.600
Welcome to the masquerade!

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:08.500
In the fragile fortress we have made!

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.400
Spinning in the shadows, out of sight!

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.800
Dancing on the edges of the night!

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.500
In the masquerade...

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.800
Take off the mask! The hour is late!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.500
We cannot always hide from fate!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:33.200
The colours bleed, the mirrors crack!

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:41.500
And there is no way turning back!

00:02:41.700 --> 00:03:24.800
[Grandiose Theatrical Synthesizer & Guitar Solo]

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.600
Welcome to the masquerade!

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:32.500
In the fragile fortress we have made!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.400
Spinning in the shadows, out of sight!

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:40.800
Dancing on the edges of the night!

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.800
In the masquerade!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.800
The painted smiles...

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.500
The fading spark...

00:03:51.700 --> 00:04:08.000
[Dramatic Piano & Strings Outro]
